DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI RbacMatrixPage shipped at parity with the web source: a pure
@Observable state holder (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing loading/open-mode/empty/
error/success over an injectable RbacMatrixDataSource seam (default = a self-consistent populated
sample actor that persists upserts; production binds the shared KMP RbacMatrixStore); an adaptive
matrix grid (columnar on macOS/iPad, per-permission cards on iPhone) with read-only marks + edit-mode
checkbox toggles bound to the model draft; the diff-then-PUT Save path with the dirty-cell count, the
saving state, and the verbatim/generic save-error banner; the my-roles + effective pills + groups-
header caption; every visible string from Localizable.xcstrings with web key names; full VoiceOver
labels/traits; deep-linkable via the new .rbacMatrix route (/admin/rbac[/matrix] aliases) and hosted
through the shell's route registry. Verified on BOTH idioms by isolated Swift 6 strict-concurrency
type-checks (0/0 macOS + iOS) and an executed model harness (23/23). The full xcodebuild scheme could
not run here: the KMP Shared.xcframework (Gradle/Kotlin-Native) timed out (CI-runner-only per
macos-pending-verifications.md) AND the app target carries a PRE-EXISTING, OUT-OF-SCOPE shared-surfaces
glass() defect (forbidden to fix). ZERO diagnostics originate in any of my files.

